e-wrap-foot><fn id="tbfnote4"><label/><p>Age adjustment is made to the site-specific EUROCARE-2 standard population. Point estimates (PE) and their standard errors (s.e.) obtained by bootstrap analyses with 10&#x02009;000 replications are given for age adjustment by the traditional method (T) and by the alternative method (A).</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-wrap></article>